### Receipts. Run the app with SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local and `docker compose up` (SeaweedFS and ClamAV).
### Paste a claimant's access token and the ids of one of their draft expenses.

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = paste-access-token-of-the-claimant
@team = paste-team-id
@expense = paste-draft-expense-id

### Upload a PDF, JPEG or PNG (up to 10 MB). The type is detected from the bytes, not the name.
# @name upload
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ledgerly

--ledgerly
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="lunch.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample-receipt.pdf
--ledgerly--

###
@receipt = {{upload.response.body.id}}

### Poll the scan status: PENDING_SCAN -> ACCEPTED or QUARANTINED
GET {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A short-lived (5 minute) download link; only for ACCEPTED receipts
GET {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}/receipts/{{receipt}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (draft expenses only)
DELETE {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}/receipts/{{receipt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
